+//
+// Message buffer slots used by the co-op texts (msg_0040):
+//   0 partner name, 1 item, 2 item quantity, 3 money amount / price,
+//   4 Pokémon species, 5 Pokémon level
+
+// Coop <sub>, <arg>, <retvar>
